      "date": "2026-01-07T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "TOKAI KOGYO Co., Ltd. agreed to acquire 50% stake in Ppap Tokai India Rubber Private Limited from PPAP Automotive Limited (BSE:532934) for INR 1 billion.",
      "body": "TOKAI KOGYO Co., Ltd. agreed to acquire 50% stake in Ppap Tokai India Rubber Private Limited from PPAP Automotive Limited (BSE:532934) for INR 1 billion on January 1, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 1 billion will be paid by TOKAI KOGYO Co., Ltd. As part of consideration, INR 1 billion is paid towards common equity of Ppap Tokai India Rubber Private Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Ppap Tokai India Rubber Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 359.6 million.\n\nThe expected completion of the transaction is February 28, 2026.",
